{"id":"vod_md_3122","vodId":"3122","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"某科学的超电磁炮S","name_cn":"某科学的超电磁炮S","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230823-1/13a605086185eda49ea3b842c21ad6fc.jpg"},"summary":"面积占东京都西部1/3、人口超过230万、八成以上由学生组成的学园都市，尖端科技发展迅速，超能力开发已经深入到城市的各个角落。超能力水平高达Level 5的御坂美琴（佐藤利奈 配音）如往常一样和初春饰利（丰崎爱生 配音）、白井黑子（新井里美 配音）等好友过着平凡的日子，间或热血爆发挫败各种扰乱城市的阴谋。某天，在调查一起现今卡事件时她邂逅了长点上机学园的布束砥信（叶山郁美 配音），从而得知用美琴的DNA大批量复制超能力者的“量产型能力者计划”。不安定的气氛在都市角落肆意蔓延……本片为镰池和马（原作）、冬川基（作画）的原作《魔法禁书目录》的外传漫画第二季TV动画。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-23 09:19:16","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/gmRB4iT9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/5C6HULov/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/N7hkdwjf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/r0j64oJD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/8sbkdbby/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/xULaomNW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/zNk7c50L/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/L3KknPZH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/mLzbumyA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/OUFwLfF3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/4I66OoOm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/EgNzyBQQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/DlvhYnNI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/E1HW1h9q/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/rAh3uNw5/index.m3u8"},{"n